1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[Kite] I have a bad feeling.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
It's like I'm missing something.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
There's a gnawing anxiety
that won't go away.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
[opening theme music playing]

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

6
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
[singer singing in English]

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
A X FATED X AWAKENING

9
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Now they continue their harrowing journey,

10
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,000
and as they head deeper and deeper
into the heart of the NGL,

11
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
hoping beyond hope to finally locate

12
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,000
the Chimera Ants' nest
within the Queen's castle,

13
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,000
they are completely unaware

14
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:23,000
that one of the King's three Royal Guards
is about to awaken.

15
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Oh, my gosh.
They were all split right in half.

16
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,000
It is quite impressive.

17
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
By the look of this one,

18
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:46,000
he was crushed by a rock
or some other hard object.

19
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Surprising, since Baro's the one
with an iron shell.

20
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
So this is what Rares are capable of.

21
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Are you getting worried now?

22
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Come on. I have the king of the jungle's
blood flowing in my veins.

23
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,000
It'll take more than a few humans
to scare me.

24
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,000
I was going to have to miss out
on the yummy feast tonight.

25
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,000
These must be
extremely rare humans indeed.

26
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,000
We'll tear them limb from limb,

27
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:17,000
and then we'll fill up our bellies
with their flesh.

28
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,000
-[Kite] We're being followed.
-[boys gasp]

29
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,000
[Kite] Not from there.

30
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
There are quite a few of them.

31
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
while attacking from a safe distance.

32
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Don't get too close.

33
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,000
[Killua] Gon and I
didn't even notice they were here.

34
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,000
[wings fluttering loudly]

35
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,000
[Killua] Ah, damn it!

36
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,000
The trees are getting in the way!

37
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,000
I think it's a trap.

38
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:59,000
[Flutter] Good. Keep up the chase.

39
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Lord Hagya,
everything is going according to plan.

40
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,000
[both chuckle]

41
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:14,000
Nice work, Flutter. Hmm?

42
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,000
one strike from my fangs
will finish them off.

43
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
Yeah, okay,
but something doesn't feel right.

44
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Huh?

45
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:29,000
[Hina] Well, you ordered Flutter
to chase down the prey

46
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
while you hid in the grass to ambush them.

47
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,000
That's pretty lame, don't you think?

48
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,000
That'd be a whole lot cooler, am I right?

49
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:53,000
You forget that this is how
the king of the jungle hunts

50
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:02,000
I guess it doesn't matter much either way
as long as I still get to eat the Rares.

51
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,000
[meat squishing]

52
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:11,000
A Rare, huh? What the hell is that?

53
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,000
I'll explain the details later.

54
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:16,000
Its number is 4-933.

55
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,000
It was caught and brought in
by Zazan's squad.

56
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
4-933?

57
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,000
Sorry. Doesn't ring a bell,

58
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:26,000
but it's probably been offered
to the Queen already.

59
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Thing is, her appetite has been getting
much more ravenous lately.

60
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,000
She's gonna give birth
to an incredible king.

61
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,000
[Peggy] Is it possible it escaped?

62
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Creatures that have been injected
with our venom

63
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
are rendered immobile
for well over a month,

64
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:56,000
so there's no way it could move freely
in just three short days.

65
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,000
You can't be certain
when it concerns the Rares.

66
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,000
They definitely aren't like
the humans we're familiar with,

67
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:06,000
and I would have thought that you,
of all people, would be aware of that.

68
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
[Pokkle] The antidote I hid in my molar
came in handy,

69
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,000
but I can barely drag myself
across the ground.

70
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:33,000
Probably best to just lay low here
for the time being.

71
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
[Peggy] Would you mind checking once more?

72
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Come on. Cut me a little slack.

73
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,000
I'm already drowning
in a bunch of work as it is.

74
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Didn't you hear what I just said?
The Queen has a huge appetite right now.

75
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:57,000
Yes, I heard you,
and I am fully aware of that.

76
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:00,000
[Pig Ant] I don't know anything
about all this "Rare" stuff,

77
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:02,000
but why are you so obsessed
with this human?

78
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,000
I'd like to ask it some questions.

79
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:20,000
I see. Then it's true that not everyone
is able to identify this power.

80
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,000
If I can just figure out
how to master this power,

81
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,000
I can become the king,

82
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,000
and I will rule!

83
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,000
-[rumbling]
-[both gasp]

84
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
[angelic choir continues]

85
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Wait. What is that?

86
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:10,000
[squeals excitedly] He's so handsome!

87
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,000
We're heading back right now.

88
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,000
Huh? But the feast…

89
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,000
[growling]

90
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:36,000
He must have understood
that he was completely outclassed

91
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,000
and backed down calmly and immediately.

92
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,000
So he's more than likely
a squadron leader.

93
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,000
[Leol] My fangs and my claws…

94
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,000
All I had to do was brandish them,

95
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:03,000
and in a blink of an eye,
I could end a creature's life

96
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,000
and satisfy my hunger.

97
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:10,000
There was no greater bliss than that.

98
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:27,000
I learned this at the cost of my life,
but it made me even stronger.

99
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:44,000
As we are now,
we have no chance of defeating them.

100
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:52,000
But we've gained a new weapon,
the ability to learn.

101
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,000
We're going to follow them.

102
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,000
[boys gasp]

103
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,000
Their nest must be close to here.

104
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,000
[gasps] What is that?

105
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:49,000
[Royal Guard]
That was an interesting story.

106
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:52,000
You mentioned something about gifts?

107
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:57,000
Do you mind… if I join you?

108
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,000
[whimpering]

109
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:08,000
[stutters] That's one of the Queen's
elite Royal Guards.

110
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:28,000
It was a dream,
a brief and foolish one at that.

111
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,000
[chuckles]

112
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,000
[Rammot] They're on
a whole different level.

113
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:58,000
A predestined status,
one that cannot be altered.

114
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:19,000
It's okay. Just relax.

115
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,000
Let's go talk over there.

116
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:28,000
[gasps] Yes, sir!

117
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,000
My power does not exist for my benefit.

118
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:39,000
It is for me to be of service to them,
as well as the king they serve.

119
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,000
[gasps]

120
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,000
[gasps]

121
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,000
[heart beating]

122
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:02,000
I have attempted
to study them many times myself,

123
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,000
but little is written about them.

124
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Asking one of them is faster than
flipping through some dusty old books.

125
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:12,000
That's why you were looking for one of
them in the first place. Isn't that right?

126
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:15,000
Yes, that was indeed
the cause of our search.

127
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,000
Yes, right here. Let's see.

128
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:25,000
"New memories are stored
in the hippocampus,

129
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:34,000
Hmm. Meow I get it.

130
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,000
manipulators,

131
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:21,000
and lastly, specialists,

132
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,000
for a total of six categories.

133
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:28,000
Ca… Categories.

134
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:04,000
are swayed significantly by…

135
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,000
by…

136
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,000
[flesh squishing]

137
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,000
by these…

138
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:17,000
these two skills.

139
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Meow I see.

140
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:29,000
[Pokkle] Besides the basics of Nen,
such as Zetsu and Ren,

141
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,000
an individual's abilit…

142
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:38,000
An individual's abilities
are deeply influenced by his own…

143
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,000
His own idiosyncrasies.

144
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:46,000
If your subtype and preference
are luckily the same…

145
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:10,000
[Pokkle] Water divination
is… is the simplest

146
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:31,000
[Royal Guard] Go ahead, Rammot.
Give it a try.

147
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,000
Yes, sir.

148
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,000
[Rammot] An enhancer?

149
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:57,000
[Peggy] More importantly, it confirms that
Rammot is a Nen user. Isn't that right?

150
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,000
Yes. I did.

151
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:11,000
I think the impact from its attacks
must have opened up your aura nodes.

152
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,000
That, in turn, released your aura.

153
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:23,000
It seems that if they're sealed,
your aura can't be released.

154
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:29,000
[Peggy] I see. In fact, Colt presented
the same theory not long ago,

155
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:01,000
[both gasp]

156
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:04,000
[chuckles] The leaf withered away.

157
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:06,000
[Peggy] Impossible.

158
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:09,000
One of us was actually born
possessing Nen ability

159
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:12,000
without having to fight a Rare
to obtain it.

160
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:17,000
Forgive me, Commander,
but that makes you a specialist, correct?

161
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:20,000
It means you don't belong
to any of the other categories?

162
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,000
It's Neferpitou.

163
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:33,000
[both] Yes, sir!

164
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:37,000
I don't need that anymore.
Go and feed him to the Queen.

165
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,000
[both] Of course.

166
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:41,000
[humming]

167
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,000
[narrator] Even from birth,

168
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:57,000
Neferpitou already possessed
incredible power.

169
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:02,000
This revelation,
while celebrated by the Chimera Ants,

170
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,000
[upbeat music playing]

171
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Gon] Next time, "Light and Dark".

172
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:38,000
[Gon imitates alarm beeping] Hey, wake up.
It's already 10:55 in the morning.

173
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[Killua] I'll kill-u-a!

174
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
